{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1SA",
 "chapter": 28,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.1",
   "range": "1SA.28.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1115a846",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.1#p1-1115a846",
     "text": "Though it was a great grief to David to fight against the people of God, yet such was his infirmity, he did not dare deny him.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Know thou assuredly"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.3",
   "range": "1SA.28.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d6c9f64d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.3#p1-d6c9f64d",
     "text": "According to the commandment of God, Ex 22:18, De 18:10,11.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "put away those that had familiar",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 22:18, De 18:10,11",
       "ref": "EXO.22.18"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 22:18, De 18:10,11",
       "ref": "DEU.18.10"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 22:18, De 18:10,11",
       "ref": "DEU.18.11"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.6",
   "range": "1SA.28.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a5c02e6a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.6#p1-a5c02e6a",
     "text": "Meaning, the high priest, Ex 28:30.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Urim",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 28:30",
       "ref": "EXO.28.30"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.8",
   "range": "1SA.28.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fafc5e5a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.8#p1-fafc5e5a",
     "text": "He does not seek God in his misery, but is led by Satan to unlawful means, which in his conscience he condemns.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "disguised himself"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.11",
   "range": "1SA.28.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "630a62cf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.11#p1-630a62cf",
     "text": "He speaks according to his gross ignorance not considering the state of the saints after this life, and how Satan has no power over them.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "Samuel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.14",
   "range": "1SA.28.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4baf4c4c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.14#p1-4baf4c4c",
     "text": "To his imagination, even though it was Satan, who to blind his eyes took on him the form of Samuel, as he can do of an angel of light.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "Samuel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.17",
   "range": "1SA.28.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "92d7fc8d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.17#p1-92d7fc8d",
     "text": "That is, to David.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.19",
   "range": "1SA.28.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "64c4d0c3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.19#p1-64c4d0c3",
     "text": "You will die, 1Sa 31:6.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "and to morrow shalt thou and",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 31:6",
       "ref": "1SA.31.6"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.20",
   "range": "1SA.28.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "eed912ee",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.20#p1-eed912ee",
     "text": "The wicked when they hear God's judgments, tremble and despair, but cannot seek for mercy by repentance.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "afraid"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.21",
   "range": "1SA.28.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0d9b3732",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.21#p1-0d9b3732",
     "text": "I have ventured my life.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "have put my life in my"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.28.24",
   "range": "1SA.28.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "89c711f6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.28.24#p1-89c711f6",
     "text": "Because it required haste.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "unleavened bread thereof"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
